60	135,470,1200,1510 - 135,470,665,772 - 950,465,1205,820	60. Potato.	The lower stem of a Potato-plant with fibrous roots and slender underground branches, each swelling at its tip into a potato, from tiny beginnings to full-grown tubers.
63	735,1712,1745,2095	63. Solomon's-Seal.	A thick, ringed rootstock of Solomon's Seal with fibrous roots beneath: the pointed bud, a, this season's stalk, b, and the round seal-like scars of earlier stalks, c, d, e.
